    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28411" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δροίτη</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bathing-tub, bath,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1540
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ch.</u>
				999(985)
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Eu.</u>
				633
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				462
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				1108
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
