				288.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> a <i>dance,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> (The form <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρύτη</span> cited from <i><span class="en">
